@startuml
!include _yunlink_protocol_theme.iuml
title Current Command Downlink Sequence

participant "Ground Client" as GROUND
participant "yunlink::Runtime\n(air)" as RT
participant "yunlink_ros_bridge" as BRIDGE
participant "Sunray control_cmd" as CMD
participant "Sunray control" as CONTROL
participant "command_execution_status" as STATUS

GROUND -> RT : command envelope
RT -> RT : target / session / authority / TTL gate
alt gate failed
  RT --> GROUND : Failed or Expired
else gate passed
  RT -> BRIDGE : typed command callback
  RT --> GROUND : Received -> Accepted ->\nInProgress -> Succeeded\n(detail=runtime-auto-result)
  BRIDGE -> CMD : publish UAVControlCMD
  CMD -> CONTROL : ROS subscriber consumes command
  CONTROL -> STATUS : publish actual execution status
  STATUS -> BRIDGE : snapshot callback
  BRIDGE --> GROUND : CommandExecutionStatusSnapshot
end

note bottom
auto-result 与实际 execution status 当前没有 correlation 关联。
end note
@enduml
